WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.132 --> 00:00:15.315
"Where am Roxy muttered as she stood in the middle of a dirt road.

2
00:00:15.335 --> 00:00:17.096
"How did I get here?"

3
00:00:17.816 --> 00:00:18.596
She looked around.

4
00:00:18.616 --> 00:00:20.857
"And where's Sun Wukong?

5
00:00:21.297 --> 00:00:23.117
He was right in front of me a second ago!"

6
00:00:24.578 --> 00:00:28.659
As Roxy explored her new surroundings, she realized she was still up in the mountains.

7
00:00:30.059 --> 00:00:32.280
But below there was nothing but dark wilderness.

8
00:00:32.936 --> 00:00:34.497
Metro City had disappeared too.

9
00:00:37.298 --> 00:00:39.940
Meanwhile, farther up the road, two demons were walking.

10
00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:44.322
"I'm relieved that Master got his mountain back," the tall demon said.

11
00:00:44.883 --> 00:00:45.923
The short demon nodded.

12
00:00:45.943 --> 00:00:48.064
"I'm looking forward to the feast.

13
00:00:48.805 --> 00:00:54.788
We'll finally eat the Tang Monk, and then we'll "Live forever!"

14
00:00:55.148 --> 00:00:57.249
both demons said at once, chuckling.

15
00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.290
The tall demon's stomach rumbled.

16
00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:04.742
"I wish we could eat right—" The short demon held up a hand to silence him.

17
00:01:04.762 --> 00:01:06.684
"Shh! I hear someone."

18
00:01:09.326 --> 00:01:12.829
The two demons hid behind a boulder as a young girl walked by.

19
00:01:12.849 --> 00:01:17.914
"She's wearing such strange clothes," the short demon said.

20
00:01:17.934 --> 00:01:20.336
"She's not from around here."

21
00:01:20.356 --> 00:01:22.178
"Let's eat her!"

22
00:01:22.558 --> 00:01:24.179
the tall demon said greedily.

23
00:01:24.199 --> 00:01:27.562
"Wait," the short demon whispered.

24
00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:29.284
"Someone else is coming!"

25
00:01:31.048 --> 00:01:32.810
Roxy heard voices approaching too.

26
00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.853
Suddenly several tough-looking men walked toward her, out of the dark.

27
00:01:37.633 --> 00:01:40.115
"Hi!" Roxy called, waving to the men.

28
00:01:40.135 --> 00:01:42.117
"Can you please tell me where I am?"

29
00:01:42.937 --> 00:01:45.459
One man stepped forward, gripping a heavy wooden club.

30
00:01:45.479 --> 00:01:49.382
"Give us all your money," he yelled.

31
00:01:50.303 --> 00:01:53.866
Roxy rolled her eyes and shot back, "You don't scare me!"

32
00:01:54.686 --> 00:01:56.107
The man stomped toward Roxy.

33
00:01:57.036 --> 00:02:02.077
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams, and the wooden club instantly burst into flames.

34
00:02:03.818 --> 00:02:06.339
"Ahh!" Roxy laughed as the man released the club.

35
00:02:07.079 --> 00:02:08.539
The other men looked frightened.

36
00:02:08.559 --> 00:02:10.800
"She's a spirit—let's run!"

37
00:02:14.941 --> 00:02:15.801
you see that?"

38
00:02:16.201 --> 00:02:17.922
the short demon whispered to the tall one.

39
00:02:18.662 --> 00:02:19.702
The tall demon nodded.

40
00:02:19.722 --> 00:02:22.383
"She has amazing magic powers.

41
00:02:22.863 --> 00:02:25.864
Do you think she's the goddess Swift Wing told our master about?"

42
00:02:26.552 --> 00:02:29.134
"She must be," the short demon replied.

43
00:02:29.995 --> 00:02:31.335
Roxy walked along the road.

44
00:02:31.355 --> 00:02:34.237
"This is bad," she thought.

45
00:02:34.257 --> 00:02:36.979
"It's dark and I have no idea where I am.

46
00:02:36.999 --> 00:02:38.380
I need to get home."

47
00:02:39.981 --> 00:02:41.923
Just then an old man and woman came along.

48
00:02:41.943 --> 00:02:45.445
"Hello, child, are you lost?"

49
00:02:45.845 --> 00:02:46.526
the man asked.

50
00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:50.729
Roxy looked at the couple for a moment, wondering if she could trust them.

51
00:02:51.589 --> 00:02:52.850
She decided they looked friendly.

52
00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:56.313
"Yes, I'm lost," Roxy admitted.

53
00:02:56.333 --> 00:03:00.275
"You look tired," the woman said.

54
00:03:00.295 --> 00:03:05.019
"We work for a wealthy squire who's quite kind.

55
00:03:05.659 --> 00:03:07.440
Why don't you come with us?

56
00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:11.223
The squire will let you stay at his house tonight."

57
00:03:13.224 --> 00:03:16.346
Roxy followed the couple to a big, beautiful house on the mountain.

58
00:03:17.947 --> 00:03:19.869
The man brought Roxy a plate of warm food.

59
00:03:21.069 --> 00:03:24.532
Then the woman showed her to a cozy bedroom, where Roxy quickly fell asleep.

60
00:03:30.272 --> 00:03:32.533
The next morning Roxy had tea with the squire.

61
00:03:32.553 --> 00:03:36.755
"You don't live around here, do you?"

62
00:03:37.455 --> 00:03:38.276
the squire asked.

63
00:03:39.056 --> 00:03:39.976
Roxy shook her head.

64
00:03:41.097 --> 00:03:42.417
The squire leaned closer.

65
00:03:42.437 --> 00:03:46.559
"Do you come from another world?"

66
00:03:47.359 --> 00:03:48.140
Roxy shrugged.

67
00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.320
"I guess so.

68
00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:52.021
My home is a lot different from this place."

69
00:03:52.902 --> 00:03:53.902
The squire smiled.

70
00:03:54.523 --> 00:03:57.504
"You have amazing powers."
